# Copy to .env.local and fill in. All are public (NEXT_PUBLIC_) — no secrets here.

# Formspree form id for the catering inquiry form (the part after /f/ in the
# endpoint URL). Without it the form validates but tells the user to email
# instead of silently swallowing the enquiry.
# Recommend pointing it at a shared catering@ inbox, not a personal one.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=

# --- Ordering storefronts are NOT env vars ---------------------------------
# They live per-location in lib/content.ts under `locations[].ordering`, because
# each of the 5 locations has its own Toast / DoorDash / Grubhub storefront and
# they are public URLs, not secrets. To connect one, paste its URL there.
# An empty string renders an honest "coming soon" state, never a dead link.
# See tasks/todo.md, phase P1.
